解: 因为角 \alpha 与角 \beta 均以 O x 为始边, 它们的终边关于原点对称, 所以 \beta =-\alpha +2 k \pi 或 \beta =\pi -\alpha +2 k \pi (k \in \mathbf{Z}). 由于 \alpha \in\left[\frac{\pi}{6}, \frac{\pi}{3}\right], 所以 -\alpha \in\left[-\frac{\pi}{3}, -\frac{\pi}{6}\right]. 当 \beta =-\alpha +2 k \pi 时, \beta \in\left[-\frac{\pi}{3}+2 k \pi, 2 k \pi\right]. 当 k=1 时, \beta \in\left[\frac{4 \pi}{3}, 2 \pi\right]. 由于 \alpha \in\left[\frac{\pi}{6}, \frac{\pi}{3}\right], 所以 -\alpha \in\left[-\frac{\pi}{3}, -\frac{\pi}{6}\right]. 当 k=1 时, \beta \in\left[\frac{4 \pi}{3}, 2 \pi\right]. 当 k=0 时, \beta \in\left[-\frac{\pi}{3}, 0\right]. 当 \beta =\pi -\alpha +2 k \pi 时, \beta \in\left[\pi -\frac{\pi}{3}+2 k \pi, \pi -\frac{\pi}{6}+2 k \pi\right] =\left[\frac{2 \pi}{3}+2 k \pi, \frac{5 \pi}{6}+2 k \pi\right]. 当 k=0 时, \beta \in\left[\frac{2 \pi}{3}, \frac{5 \pi}{6}\right]. 当 k=1 时, \beta \in\left[\frac{11 \pi}{6}, \frac{13 \pi}{6}\right]. 因为 \beta \in\left[-\frac{\pi}{3}, 2 \pi\right], 所以 \beta \in\left[\frac{2 \pi}{3}, 2 \pi\right] 或 \left[\frac{11 \pi}{6}, \frac{13 \pi}{6}\right]. 由于 \alpha \in\left[\frac{\pi}{6}, \frac{\pi}{3}\right], 所以 -\alpha \in\left[-\frac{\pi}{3}, -\frac{\pi}{6}\right]. 当 \beta =-\alpha +2 k \pi 时, \cos \beta =\cos(-\alpha +2 k \pi) =\cos \alpha. 因为 \alpha \in\left[\frac{\pi}{6}, \frac{\pi}{3}\right], 所以 \cos \alpha \in\left[\cos \frac{\pi}{3}, \cos \frac{\pi}{6}\right] =\left[\frac{1}{2}, \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\right]. 当 \beta =\pi -\alpha +2 k \pi 时, \cos \beta =\cos(\pi -\alpha +2 k \pi) =\cos(\pi -\alpha) =-\cos \alpha. 因为 \alpha \in\left[\frac{\pi}{6}, \frac{\pi}{3}\right], 所以 \cos \alpha \in\left[\frac{1}{2}, \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\right]. 所以 \cos \beta \in\left[-\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}, \frac{1}{2}\right]. 所以 \cos \beta 的最大值为 \frac{1}{2}.

